<title>HONG KONG: Shanghai Ind shrs steady after placement.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Ind shrs steady after placement.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd were little changed after the company announced a share placement to raise funds for its purchase of assets in China, brokers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company's shares eased marginally by HK$0.10 to HK$35.40 in early trade on volume of 50.45 million shares.</p>
<p>Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it would by a 35 percent stake in two roads in Shanghai for US$600 million, which would be financed by the issue of 139.47 million new shares at HK$34.18 per share.</p>
</text>
